!.env.example
# Never ship the host's incremental tsc cache into the image — a stale
# .tsbuildinfo makes `tsc -b` skip files or report phantom errors. Excluding it
# forces a clean, deterministic full typecheck on every Docker build.
*.tsbuildinfo
.tsbuildinfo
# The root image builds only the Solid/Vite SPA. The Rust gateway and separate
# Next.js marketing app have their own build contexts and must not inflate this
# context (the latter also contains large design-reference media).
apps/gateway
apps/verevon-web
apps/**/target
apps/**/.next
